hade for seedlings in nurseries.\n\n\u2022 Pitcher irrigation - two water-filled pots\n\nare buried on either side of the plant and refilled every few days. The side of each pot facing away from the plant is sealed or painted, while the unpainted porous side allows water to seep out and supply water to the plant."
