tute to be adopted during rainy periods in coconut cultivation.\n\n\u2022 Applying fertilizer and new planting of\n\ncoconut seedlings in the field.\n\n\u2022 Constructing or repairing contour drains\n\nand drainage channels; when constructing drainage channels, a gentle slope and the incorporating barriers can improve water infiltration into the soil."
